---
description: Real data, agent tools and external effects
alwaysApply: true
---
- Demo, stale, unknown and live states must be distinct.
- Enforce tenant boundaries and capability authorization on the server.
- Keep secrets out of client bundles, screenshots and traces.
- Preview and approve consequential actions; require idempotency and audit.
- Read-only diagnostics are not permission to book, charge, publish or deploy.
- Display observable tool activity, not purported access to hidden model reasoning.
- Voice input is opt-in; stop microphone tracks and audio on cancellation or exit.

